            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Restrain"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "When the jailer makes a successful mancatcher Strike, their target must succeed at a DC 27 Reflex save or become grabbed until the end of the jailer's next turn.\n\nEach time the target fails an attempt to Escape the jailer, it takes 2d6 piercing damage."
